OL,3,GNEWSAHomelessness work to be expanded
OL,4,Ain city
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomeless people in Wolverhampton will
OL,7,Fget more support this winter after the
OL,8,Fcity council was awarded #505,000 by
OL,9,Fthe government.
OL,11,FThe money will be spent on
OL,12,Faccommodation, extra support staff and
OL,13,Fan expansion of the city's outreach
OL,14,Fprogramme.
OL,16,FThe city council entered a partnership
OL,17,Fwith local charity Good Shepherd last
OL,18,Fyear and was able to house 99 people
OL,19,Fand move another 23 into private rented
OL,20,Faccommodation.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
