OL,3,GNEWSAHomelessness work to be expanded
OL,4,Ain city
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Evans, the councillor responsible
OL,7,Ffor housing, said it was his
OL,8,Fauthority's long-term ambition that
OL,9,Fnobody should have to sleep rough on
OL,10,Fthe streets.
